# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in.
# Production values are set with `npx wrangler secret put AUTH_USERNAME` / `AUTH_PASSWORD`.
#
# FR-003a: the password MUST be a randomly generated value of at least 20 characters,
# e.g. generated with:  openssl rand -base64 30
AUTH_USERNAME=
AUTH_PASSWORD=
